Hello Scouts!

I'm here to address a few problems with the game.

About the problem to launch the game, to address that I made DirectX 11 to be the default graphics API. It should provide the best compatibility with Intel and AMD chips. You will need to restart steam for it to work;

Sometimes on the Level 8 the game will not spawn a banana, a crucial item needed to complete the level. This is a bug with the game itself, and right now the best solution that I have right now is to load a different level and go back to the level 8 to restart the level;

We are right now working on a big update for the game that will fix these main 2 issues. It will also add more content to the game and will address many of the criticisms that we receive.

Sorry for anything and have fun :)

Hello everyone,

This small update brings:

 Joystick support;
 Fix a major issue in the game last level that was stopping players to complete the level;


We are still working on the game and we have plans to release a new content update in first quarter of the next year. It won't be the next season just yet, but we are going to improve the current season by adding more game elements like: puzzles, interactions and better hiding spots for all the items;

If you have any suggestions please let us know down in the comments.

Thanks for been with us and happy holidays!
Felipe
